  "acceptance": [
    "Consume v1 Lag INT64 after LeaderEpoch before ErrorCode; request body remains v0. Raw signed lag retained by typed wire result; public lag accessor returnsNone for every negative value andSome for nonnegative values like official SharePartitionOffsetInfo. v0 typed result has absent lag/default-1.",
    "Existing Admin describe/list_share_group_offsets negotiate highest <=1 and correctly consume v1, explicitly project to unchanged legacy result. A new typed public with-lag operation exposes the field. Both paths share one retry/coordinator routing implementation.",
    "Public Admin tests cover0-only,1-only,0..1,unsupported; actual group coordinator type0 routing (never controller/Metadata leader), coordinator16/14/15 refresh, partial group errors/duplicates/order, exact one-shot deadline/cancellation and unsupported-before-discovery.",
    "Independent fixtures cover lag-1/othernegative/0/positive/MAX, null/all versus empty/named requests, group/partition errors, flexible unknown tags, duplicate groups and malformed/truncated counts/fields. Genuine official listShareGroupOffsets public request and returned Optional lag must be observed separately from codec/handler fixtures.",
    "Keep existing public struct-literal types and legacy wire helpers source/byte compatible; additive typed APIs expose the new field without silently discarding it at the wire boundary.",
    "Fail invalid/unsupported versions before unrelated metadata/coordinator/network work. Positive nested-count/minimum-byte and frame/resource checks precede allocation; full successful body/header consumption and exact correlation/version are asserted.",
    "Preserve the existing operation routing/retry implementation once; both legacy projection and new typed operation share the same coordinator/leader invalidation and absolute deadline.",
    "Pin actual Apache4.1.2/4.2.1/4.3.1 jars, schemas and source. Execute independent fixtures in applicable versions and retain actual unsupported outcomes on4.1.2; do not claim fabricated full broker transaction/share semantics.",
    "Freeze and push exact source before immutable stable+1.85 default/all-feature behavioral/strict fmt/Clippy/rustdoc/doctest qualification; preserve first failures and all initial preparation attempts."
  ]
